Etchwise is based on Raspberry Pi Imager v2.0.7
(https://github.com/raspberrypi/rpi-imager), Copyright (C) 2020 Raspberry Pi Ltd,
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE). It is a Rust/Tauri port
with modifications: it is renamed, has its own look and icon, can merge extra
OS repositories (e.g. for Intel NUC) alongside the official Raspberry Pi list,
and sends no usage statistics. Data files under crates/imager-core/data/ and the UI translations are taken
from that project.

